<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed one single credit auction whereby it sought to inject 1.218 billion pesos in the secondary market.</p>
<p>The credit was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTION   TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.218 bln pesos  1 day    25.35  25.35   25.35    3    3</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
